<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER SHOWCASE-FEYENOORD-AJAX DRAW 2-2.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-FEYENOORD-AJAX DRAW 2-2.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feyenoord and Ajax Amsterdam drew 2-2 (half-time 2-1) in their Dutch first division match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Feyenoord - Ronald Koeman 4 pen, Bernard Schuiteman 16.</p>
<p>Ajax - Ronald de Boer 15 pen, Patrick Kluivert 62</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
